WEBVTT

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.950
Last time on <i>Demon Lord, Retry</i>...

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.500
"Status change: 'Battle Ready'"
"Stance change: 'Retaliation Stance'"

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:20.290
N-No! I don't wanna be killed
by a human in a place like this!

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.370
I'm sure you've done plenty of killing till now.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.290
You should at least feel
what it's like to die for once.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.620
What filthy fireworks.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.160
"Satanist Assembly Hall"

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.620
"Tron"
What in the world happened?

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:09.410
They unleashed it much too early.
That damn Merge must have lost his mind.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:14.040
I-I'm sure something unexpected
must have happened.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:18.370
"Satanist Founder" "Utopia"
Tron, take that and tell them to use the remaining two

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:20.290
at the Holy Castle.

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:25.830
I'm sure even a failure mixed-blood
like you can manage that much.

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:26.830
Right...

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.830
Begone at once. You're an eyesore.

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:41.870
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:48.410
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:52.040
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.330
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:58.750
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:07.540
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:14.040
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:20.870
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:28.120
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.450
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.910
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:40.330
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:43.790
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:47.080
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:50.700
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.870
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:57.450
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.080
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:01.080
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:09.000
"All or Nothing"

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.500
"Upscale Bar"
"Artemis"

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.870
Here's a beautiful flower
for such beautiful people!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.080
Artemis is on a different level.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:24.540
They even brought out a clown
to calm down the guests.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:31.200
Yes, because nobles like us must
remain staunch even in times like this.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:36.580
What a fool of a Holy Maiden
to be without escort.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.450
"Shrimpfry Butterfly"
The queen of high society,

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.750
"Shrimpfry Butterfly"
Shrimpfry Butterfly...

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.790
"Luna Elegant"
She has a sharp eye for people,

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:47.000
"Aku"
and has connections all over the place.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.700
"Yu Kirino"
The others must be the Holy Maiden's friends.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.660
"Assassin Clown" "Kamiya"
Luna Elegant...

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:57.660
You're the next target
the Satanists want me to kill.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:03.040
He said he'd be right back,
so what in the world is taking him so long?

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.540
Don't worry, Sister Luna.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:10.500
Not once has Demon Lord
broken a promise he's made.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:15.080
Aku is probably right.
Let's be patient and wait.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:19.500
Oh, my, what a fine collection
of precious people!

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.160
You sparkle so much, it's blinding me!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.660
What a friendly clown we have here.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:29.580
Do you mind if I show off
a little trick of my own?

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.750
Argh, how can someone
as pretty as you do tricks too?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.620
I'm so envious!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:46.040
Wh-What? My...

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:50.700
Did you drop your left arm?
Or perhaps your right arm?

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:54.000
B-Both.... I think?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.370
Oh, you're such a greedy one.

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:59.200
But I'll do you a special service today!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:07.370
Oops, I'm sorry. I think I mixed up
your right and left arms.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.500
W-Wait a sec! This is no laughing matter!

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.410
I've seen my fair share of magic tricks,

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:18.500
but I haven't the faintest idea
how you pulled off that one.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.370
I'm glad that you enjoyed it, Madam.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.330
This time I'll make sure to put them on right.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:31.410
Th-They're attached! My arms are attached!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:35.830
Make sure not to drop them next time, Mr. Clown.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:40.830
Also, that poison in your pocket
gives off quite the strong odor.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:44.870
If you want to kill someone,
use something better than that.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.410
And if I ever see you again,
I'll slice you up alive.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.000
Be careful now, Mr. Clown.

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:15.160
"Deranged Holy Maiden"
"Killer Queen"

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:21.290
"Officer"
"Mount Fuji"

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:32.120
Sister, looks like we've got our hands full!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:36.160
You moron. Did you come along
only to spew bullshit like that?

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:44.080
"Low-Level Demons" "Hanitora"
Oh, my, what cute muscles.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.000
"Low-Level Demons" "Hanitora"
Hey, you big burly man.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.870
How about you come play--

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.290
You stink like a sack of shit.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:53.750
Sprint for me, fastest fingers!

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:55.750
"Carnage Wheel"
Drag Car!

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:03.580
Go back to the sewer and f*** yourself,
you vomit-faced b****!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:07.200
Y-You little...! That was my little sister!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.080
Whew, that was a nice one.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:17.160
"Head Soldier" "Marshall Arts"
Compared to you on the battlefield,

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:20.910
"Head Soldier" "Marshall Arts"
this old guard is insignificant.

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:24.790
I said you're too old for this,
you damn grandpa.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:37.200
O abysmal darkness,
shower the world with mourning.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.000
"Divine Rain" "Holy Rain"
Holy Rain!

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.790
You low and feeble humans.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:52.370
When faced with my darkness,
you're completely powerless.

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:56.120
Become my puppets and fight until you crumble.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.660
"Divine Bubbles" "Bubble Cure"
Bubble Cure!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.950
We're so grateful, Lady Mink.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.790
That's an S-Rank adventurer for you!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:12.200
But what are those sinister-sounding
incantations all about?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.500
She's elite enough to be called a star player.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:18.160
I'm sure she has her reasons for it.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:23.540
I order you to follow my lead!
Shed your blood for the chilling darkness!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.500
Y-Yeah...

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:29.250
"Devilkin S-Rank Adventurer" "Organ"
What is she even fighting against anyway?

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:39.660
By the looks of it, I take it
you got roughed up pretty bad.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.540
Yeah...

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:47.950
I-I'm terribly sorry. Merge and the others
were all killed in battle...

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:51.040
H-How is that possible? What happened?

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.410
I-It was... the Demon Lord...

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.950
Now that it's come to this, we have no choice.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:03.910
Yes... May disaster befall this cursed land!

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:07.870
Summon Devil!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:41.160
"Prince of Darkness"
"Oruit"

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:47.120
What a bothersome place I've been summoned to.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:49.410
A divine barrier, huh?

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.660
"Eldest Holy Maiden"
"Angel White"

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:03.950
This evil power...
Could it be a high-level Demon?

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.250
Protection of the Seraph! Angel Veil!

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.370
"Angel Barrier"
"Angel Veil"

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:20.160
This is truly unpleasant...

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:25.040
The prince? What's going on here?

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:29.000
And what's more, it seems
there's some dogs of the angels.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.580
Sister, I'll handle this!

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.040
Fuji, don't!

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.750
Are you okay?

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:51.040
I refuse to believe that ants
like you can walk on two legs.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.750
"Imprisonment Area" "Killing Field"
Killing Field!

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:17.580
It's taking everything I've got
to protect the Holy Castle...

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:32.040
"Tron" "Race: Devilkin" "Sex: Female"
"Age: ?" "Height: 143cm"

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:37.080
"Oruit" "Race: Demon" "Sex: ?"
"Age: ?" "Height: ?"

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:44.370
Shall I finally break it out?

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:48.750
Thank you!

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:59.450
"Holy Hammer Sigma"

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.500
The Prince of Darkness, is it?

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:09.160
As I thought, it's fate for darkness
to be drawn to darkness.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.200
Lousy holy powers coming one after another...

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.830
Don't you dare look away!

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:41.080
Such uncivilized women.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:42.750
"Darkness Beam" "Black Eraser"
Black Eraser!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.040
Protect me on the double!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.330
"Light Wall" "Light Wall"
Light Wall!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.830
My favorite weapon "Twinkle"
denies the very existence of evil beings!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.000
Not bad for some giant jugs.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.290
J-Jugs?! Now listen here...!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:30.660
Shit, not Hades again!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.000
You're kidding... Why is Hades
in a place like this?

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.790
Filthy humans.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.160
This is the end for you.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.160
"Darkness Prison Beam" "Ray of Darkness"
Ray of Darkness!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.040
You lowly humans.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.540
Queen!

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:42.330
Stay back, Sister! Maintain the barrier!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.620
B-But...!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:47.080
You've got to be kidding me...

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:50.910
This situation's ridiculous,
and that outfit of hers is too.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:54.160
Is that the other Holy Maiden?

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:57.160
She's outrageously beautiful on the outside,

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:01.540
but if she's their older sister,
something's gotta be wrong with her.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:11.000
Now then, shall we begin this lovely feast?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:15.040
The sin of annoying me is grave, indeed!

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.950
You shithead!

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:21.370
I haven't researched the Seraph yet,
and just when I'm about to get started...!

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:25.370
I'm not letting some damn
monster like you get in my way!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:30.830
I-I know! I can just make him deal
with another annoying Holy Maiden!

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.700
"Administrator Privileges"

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.540
"Character Change"
"Unable to Control"

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:43.450
What's this light?!

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.200
Mis'er Zewwo!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.700
What's your deal?

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:06.120
Getting picked on again, huh?

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:08.750
Y-You came to help?

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:14.450
Is this another new arena of that shitty Empire?

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.500
Got some weird monster here too...

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:24.290
You bastard... Where did you come from?

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:36.540
You smell like shit, boy.
That's the scent of a murderer.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.500
You bastard!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.790
"Sense of Justice"
I'm the very definition of unrivaled!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.580
"Sense of Justice"
I've found truth down the path of carnage!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:59.040
"For each 1 person the target has killed..."

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:01.660
"...damage increases by 5"

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:07.410
What filth. Is that your incantation or--

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:25.410
You're scum that makes women cry.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.200
I'll teach you just how weak you really are.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.040
Come on, who said you could lie down?!

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:38.330
Hmph! How pathetic, wailing like some sissy...

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:41.660
You... You're nothing but trash!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.500
Ray of Darkness!

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:53.370
What kind of little plaything was that?

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:58.790
Listen, can you really afford to play
around while trying to screw with me?

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:01.580
You... You're kidding me...

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:11.580
Someone as grand as I
will not go down like this!

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:22.040
"Bloodsucking"

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:27.450
Ugh, such disgusting blood.
It stinks so bad I can't bear it.

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:04.870
I wonder... For what purpose was I even born?

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:11.870
I can't believe what you've done.

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:15.660
Hey, runt. You alive?

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.950
Hey, open your mouth!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.540
Can't you hear me, runt?

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:26.950
Huh?

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:30.290
"Calorie Hell"
That was one of my prized recovery items.

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:32.040
You should be all right now.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.580
The wound... is gone.

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.910
You're a gloomy one, runt.

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:42.410
I saved your life, so how about
you smile or something?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.580
Smile...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.580
I forgot how to a long time ago.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.700
What in the world was that healing power?

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:56.870
Don't tell me he's a new race of Dragon?

00:19:56.870 --> 00:20:00.330
This is dangerous... Too dangerous!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:05.500
In that case, I vow with my heart and soul
to kill this Dragon no matter what!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:28.870
You aggravate me, Dragon!

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:33.290
Your neutrality and arrogance
are about to be judged by me!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.700
Go on and smile, runt.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.950
No matter how tough it gets,

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:45.120
the ones who keep smiling like
idiots are stronger than anyone else.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:53.450
Dragon! This is the end
for you and your arrogance!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:58.580
Heaven! Watch and learn from the best!

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:04.790
"All or Nothing"
All or Nothing!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:19.660
Demon Lord, watch this!

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:21.450
Hmm? What is it?

00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:25.330
Ahem! I'm the very definition of unrivaled!

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:26.330
Huh?

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:28.580
I've found truth down the path of carnage!

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.370
Wh-What?

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:32.750
Heaven! Watch and learn from the best!

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:33.410
Wait!

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:36.290
All or Nothing!

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:39.830
I think someone put her
up to this like last time!

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:44.120
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry </i>Episode 8.
"Demon Lord's Handiwork."

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:46.450
Whoever you are, show yourself!
